SUMMARY:Lititz Game Club at the Lititz Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\nA place for people to come together and 
 play tabletop games. Whether you enjoy casual games like Uno and Scrabble\
 , gateway games like Catan\, Wingspan\, and Ticket to Ride\, or more strat
 egic games like Scythe and Terraforming Mars\, we have plenty of fun games
  to play. A game library with a wide selection of games is available\, but
  feel free to bring your own (family-friendly) games as well!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/315501266/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260701T164322Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260701T164322Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
UID:event_316304331@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043241Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T213000
SUMMARY:Dillsburg Game Night - Calvary Methodist Church in the Family Cent
 er
DESCRIPTION:Central PA Game Club\nDillsburg Game Night meets every Wednesd
 ay from 6:30-9:30pm for casual tabletop games. We’ve been going strong s
 ince 2016\, and most Wednesdays you’ll find about 30-40 gamers who love 
 to learn and teach new games. It’s a great group of friendly people.\n\n
 Given the timeframe\, most of the games played are light to medium Euros\,
  although many of us also love card games (including trick-taking games) a
 nd party games. We have a library of about 200 games available to play\, a
 nd people typically bring their own games as well.\n\nWe also run long gam
 e days (typically every other month\, usually a Saturday 2-9pm) and other 
 special events. Join us on Facebook or Discord for more information about 
 those.\n\nAttendees do not often RSVP on Meetup. It may show 1 person is c
 oming but we have 40 people every Wednesday and will cancel the event if i
 t is not happening. Feel free to message with questions.\n\nCost: Free\nWh
 o: All Ages (15 and under must be accompanied by an adult)\nWhen: Every We
 dnesday (6:30-9:30pm)\nWhere: Calvary Methodist Church (Dillsburg\, PA) Fa
 mily Center\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/2249345335100181\nD
 iscord: https://discord.gg/sJ4sHfNEdu
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/centralpagameclub/events/316304331/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260827T225632Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T225632Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Central PA Game Club
